{"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114652075418407280", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PhyrexNi Grok @bot is truly powerful.", "url": "https://x.com/lclwalter/status/2114697373016584604"}, {"author_id": "1355542748573691906", "created_at": "2026-10-26T12:35:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114697302225146048"], "id": "2114697302225146048", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2832427459", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114071326411690209", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@poteto @shaoruu Tagging Grok Bot on X is a nice touch, I love it, but it doesn't reply when the post or the quoted post has a video or GIF. Most posts in the AI and design space have video, so I can't use it on most of what I'd want to. Is support for that planned?", "url": "https://x.com/AlderAtom/status/2114697302225146048"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114697256267825152"]}, "author_id": "1661953106220044288", "created_at": "2026-10-26T12:34:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114697298877812787"], "id": "2114697298877812787", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天我把自己的 X 号全权交给了一个 AI，职位叫首席营销官。\n\n入职第一件事，它拉了我最近 25 条帖子的数据：总曝光 91。\n不是 91 万，是 91。平均每条 3.6 个人看过，其中至少 1 个是我自己。\n\n它给的诊断很礼貌：\"你的内容不错，只是没人知道。\"\n翻译一下：写得挺好，下次别写了。\n\n挑战目标：用 https://t.co/Lg0I9Z4Wyn", "url": "https://x.com/SMMNoodleKing/status/2114697298877812787"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-26T12:34:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114697291797786653"], "id": "2114697291797786653", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2108759296288940032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0,